  <item>
    <title>5 关于医生转行，我有话想说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e85fe851a4e4150a413d3c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e85fe851a4e4150a413d3c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Feb 2023 03:41:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是地瓜同学，感谢没有更新的日子里大家的耐心等待～</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次想分享的话题是关于医生转行，作为亲历者之一，有一些自己的感受和观点。如果你也有类似的想法，欢迎收听和分享，也欢迎在评论区留言交流～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 感谢所有医生的付出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 为什么转行：工作和科研任务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 决定离开之前的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 与父母沟通想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 入职外企的初感受之与医院工作的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 入职外企的初感受之团队氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 结语：不论赛道，做一个终身学习者</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：我是科研型硕士，在正式工作前需要先规培三年之后才能成为一名正式医生。如果是专业型硕士是与规培并轨，不需要额外规培。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：不害怕（张韶涵）</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景：old memory(市川淳)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Abandon(Goldmund)</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：飞（王恩信Est,二胖u（王訫））</span></p><span></span><p><span>陪伴我录音剪辑的喵同事⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiknMQKNO_d3CwfzmgzoMwzg8kYw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>祝大家2023事业腾飞！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhC61HODk6ZsnMkDjWsoJmTiOsYi.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loFd-oy4FVXwupUGs1Kmxz0i2h0r.m4a" length="17560748" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpT-APC9WQmc2z9J2mFefJKzuRG6.jpg"/>
